> How can I haveNethack create bones files?

Any time you die deeper than dungeon level 3, and it is NOT a branching
level (like the one with the stairs to the Mines or to Sokoban), the end
level of some dungeon branch (like the Mines), anywhere in Sokoban, or one
of the special levels defined not to generate bones, the game MAY create a
bones file. 
But it is never guaranteed in a normal game. It's random.

